Zenith 0009: volume popup redesign. Default: a pill at the top center (icon, bar, percentage) coloured from the
menu theme; themes can restyle it with <menuVolume name="menuvolume"> in the menu view (pos, origin, size,
cornerRadius, color, barColor, trackColor, textColor, fontPath, fontSize).

